<title>HONG KONG: China's stock exchanges close for 3-day holiday.</title>
<headline>China's stock exchanges close for 3-day holiday.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Shanghai and Shenzhen stock exchanges will close for three days during celebrations to mark China's National Day, the official Securities Times in Shenzhen said on Friday.</p>
<p>There will be no stock trading on the two bourses between September 30 and October 2, and trading will resume on October 3, the paper said.</p>
<p>China's National Day is October 1.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
